    Level 10 - Sunken Gardens
    Flooded ancient ruins. In water a Small ball floats up fast, a Normal ball
    floats up slowly and a Big ball sinks (and can only roll along the
    bottom). Under water the ball slowly loses air; bubble streams (o) refill it.

    1. shallow pool: gems on the bottom (sink as Big), one above (jump out)
    2. sink and rise: roll under the pillar as Big, a ledge only Small fits on
    3. the deep well: sink past two overhangs, smash the cracked wall for the
       key, then float back up as Small the other way round
    4. flooded hall: hanging pillars (sink under as Big) and low pillars
       (float over as Small) one after another; pump and bubbles on the way
    5. final gate: smash the cracked wall under water, rise, open the door

    Legend:  . empty   # ground   = carved block   C cracked   ~ water
             P pump    * gem      E crab   B jellyfish   S start   G goal
             H checkpoint  K key  D locked door   o bubble stream
